==Battleground==
*10 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*5 [[Znache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ghost Doge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33~26.67 seconds<sup>400f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ghost Snache]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Miss Haka]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Znache]]s spawn, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
**2 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn, delay 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
**5 [[Zroco]]s spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**10 [[Zroco]]s spawn, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
**3 [[Zir Zeal]]s spawn, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.

